+          through the same point. prev_season_full: the whole season before. delta_yoy: this
+          season minus the season before at the same point. sum_season: totalled over the
+          season. form: over the team's form window. home or away: the fixture's home or away
+          side. opponent: the opposing team. last_meeting: the two teams' previous meeting.
+          recent_meetings: each of their recent meetings. A side and a period join with an
+          underscore, as in home_form.
+      - name: window_column
+        description: >
+          Where the table holds several windows, the column that says which one a row holds
+          (window_type): filter on it. NULL where the table holds one.
+      - name: metric_key_column
+        description: >
+          In a long-format table, the column that names the metric on each row (metric_key):
+          filter it to metric_id. NULL where the metric has a column of its own.
